                    {"title": "MCP integration with external AI tools", "desc": "The Model Context Protocol connects Summer Engine to outside AI coding assistants like Claude Code, Codex, and Cursor, so developers can work through their preferred tool."},
                    {"title": "Multi-platform export", "desc": "Finished projects can be exported to Steam, desktop (Windows/macOS), and mobile targets, depending on the toolchains and templates installed."},
