                      'content types where you switch autonomy on. It pushes to WordPress, Webflow, Sanity or Wix, or to its own hosted CMS. A visibility '
                      'module tracks whether your brand shows up in AI answers, and Content Guard watches published pages for traffic or ranking drops and '
                      'drafts a repair for approval. An MCP server and CLI let you drive it from other AI tools. Frase lists SOC 2 Type II and GDPR compliance '
                      'on its site; I did not independently verify those.',
