                    {"q": "How does Poe's pricing work?", "a": "Paid plans (Starter through Pro Max, $4.99–$249.99/mo) grant a monthly allowance of \"compute points\" that are spent per message; point cost varies by model and by the length of context sent, and annual billing saves roughly 17%."},
