                    {"q": "What's the difference between the \"for Pros\" and \"for Life\" plans?", "a": "\"for Pros\" is a $19/month subscription with 225 Megatokens per year, scheduled commands and advanced automation; \"for Life\" is a single $240 payment that gives lifetime access to the app itself (bring your own API keys or use free web-session connections), with Cloud AI tokens purchasable separately at a discount."}
