                    {"q": "How much does PageLens.ai cost?", "a": "Monitor is $49/mo (ChatGPT only), Optimize is $199/mo (adds Google AI Mode and Perplexity), Growth is $699/mo (adds Claude, Gemini, Grok and Copilot plus done-for-you content publishing), and Enterprise is custom-priced; annual billing saves about 8%."},
                    {"q": "What makes PageLens different from a typical AEO tracking tool?", "a": "Most AEO tools stop at a dashboard. PageLens's Growth plan also researches, drafts and publishes the actual missing content to a /feed subdirectory on the customer's own domain, then re-measures whether it earned a citation — closing the loop rather than leaving that work to the customer."},
                    {"q": "Which AI engines does PageLens.ai track?", "a": "ChatGPT on the entry Monitor plan; Optimize adds Google AI Mode and Perplexity; Growth and Enterprise add Claude, Gemini, Grok and Microsoft Copilot for full seven-engine coverage."},
                    {"q": "Does the content PageLens writes stay on my own site?", "a": "Yes — content publishes to a CNAME'd /feed subdirectory on the customer's own domain rather than a PageLens-hosted page, so the URLs, traffic and SEO equity belong to the brand and are portable if they ever switch tools."},
