                    {"q": "How is BrightEdge different from dedicated AEO-only tools?", "a": "BrightEdge built its AI-search features (AI Catalyst, and the newer AI Hyper Cube launched March 2026) on top of nearly two decades of proprietary SEO data via its Data Cube, giving it deep historical and competitive context that dedicated AEO-only startups lack."},
                    {"q": "Which AI engines does BrightEdge track?", "a": "AI Catalyst and AI Hyper Cube track brand presence, sentiment, and citations across Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, and Perplexity, alongside BrightEdge's traditional multi-engine organic search tracking across 170 countries."},
                    {"q": "Is BrightEdge a good fit for smaller teams?", "a": "Not typically. BrightEdge delivers the best ROI for large enterprises with 2,000+ pages and a dedicated SEO team of three or more; solo SEOs and small teams often find it too complex and expensive relative to the value they can extract."},
                    {"q": "What is AI Hyper Cube?", "a": "AI Hyper Cube is BrightEdge's AI-search competitive intelligence feature, launched in March 2026, that shows whether a brand is cited in AI-generated answers, which competitors appear alongside it, and how AI search share-of-voice changes over time."},
                    {"q": "Does BrightEdge offer a free trial?", "a": "No self-serve free trial is generally available; BrightEdge sells through an annual, sales-assisted contract process typical of enterprise SEO platforms."},
