      {"q": "Is there a free trial?", "a": "Outreach does not publicly advertise a self-serve free trial; prospective customers typically go through a sales-led demo and pilot process."},
      {"q": "Can Outreach handle phone calls, not just email?", "a": "Yes, sequences support click-to-dial calling steps and the platform includes call recording and conversation intelligence."},
