                    {"q": "How much does VEA AI cost?", "a": "VEA AI runs on per-user monthly pricing across four tiers, from around $25-30/user/month for Business Class up to several hundred dollars per user/month for the top Owners Club tier, with lower rates available on annual billing."},
                    {"q": "Who is VEA AI best suited for?", "a": "It's best suited for owners of client-based service businesses — such as contractors, agencies, and consultancies — who want a consolidated AI-managed system for operations instead of juggling separate CRM, accounting, and task-management tools."},
