      {"q": "What happens if I run out of AI credits?", "a": "You can top up credits any time (from $5 to $10,000, with volume bonuses), connect your own AI subscription/API key, or upgrade plans; monthly add-on credits carry a 30-day grace window after each billing cycle."},
      {"q": "Does Draftbit lock me into its platform?", "a": "No — paid plans include full code editing and the ability to export your entire codebase to GitHub or a zip file at any time."},
      {"q": "Is there a free plan?", "a": "Yes, the Free plan includes 5,000 one-time credits, one sandbox, all visual editing features, a built-in Supabase backend, and one-click publishing to a draftbit.dev subdomain."}
