      {"q": "Is PaperRater free?", "a": "Yes, historically the base plan was free for up to 6 pages, with a $7.95 one-time fee for longer documents or a $14.95/month Premium subscription for unlimited use."},
      {"q": "What happens to my PaperRater account data?", "a": "Learneo says user accounts and personal data (name, email, billing info) will be deleted after the shutdown, subject to limited retention required by law."}
