      {"q": "Can I sell designs made with Xinva?", "a": "Yes — Xinva's plans, including the free tier, include commercial use rights, and the platform markets itself specifically to sellers on marketplaces like Redbubble, Printify, Printful, and Merch by Amazon."},
      {"q": "Does Xinva support niches beyond t-shirts?", "a": "Yes, in addition to t-shirt designs, Xinva offers dedicated generators for stickers, seamless patterns, tattoo art, and furry-style art."},
      {"q": "Is Xinva suited for general AI image generation?", "a": "Not primarily — Xinva is purpose-built for print-on-demand merchandise design rather than general illustration, photorealistic imagery, or broader creative use cases."}
